File Index

/jest.config.cjs
Purpose: Self-contained node jest config; maps merc-area and workspace types to TS sources. services-server is mapped to just auth-introspect-client.ts (not the package's full index.ts barrel) — the barrel also pulls in mud-client-service.ts's ESM-only uuid dependency, which ts-jest can't transform.

/package.json
Purpose: Express-based API server package (port 61000) bridging the builder UI to the merc-mud area folder.

/tsconfig.json
Purpose: NodeNext build config mirroring kingdom-tactics-server.
